5,1,1,talk,Servas,,"We must ensure the chosen project is not just brilliant on paper, but viable in practice. The human element is the most fragile part of any great endeavor.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Sakura,,"I agree! But I also wonder if the money actually covers everything. Some things seem to get more expensive every year, right? Let's find the hidden secrets!","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,Um... I think... maybe we should see if similar projects actually finished on time in the past? I'm worried about things just... stopping.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Takumi,,Exactly. Too many grants waste time on nonsense that isn't science. I want to know exactly where the work gets interrupted before we commit the money.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Minako,,"We should focus on the operational viability. If the shared infrastructure is overloaded, the best proposal will still fail. We need to check the current state of services.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Servas,,"@Minako, you are wise. A seed cannot grow without soil. I shall look into the people who tend that soil, for their hands are irreplaceable.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"Ooh, a treasure hunt! I want to see where the money goes and who is actually doing the work. Maybe there are some funny surprises in the ledgers!","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,I... I just don't want us to make a mistake. I'll look at the old files to see what actually worked. If that's okay with everyone.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"Stop being so timid, Daisuke! We need hard data on failures. I'm going to check the incident logs and the portfolio overruns. No more excuses.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Minako,,I will investigate the facility day rates and the accreditation bookings. We must know if there is actually room for a new project to breathe.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Servas,,"It is a balanced approach. We look at the past, the present, and the people. This is how we build a legacy that lasts.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Sakura,,"Yay! I'm so excited! I bet I'll find something that makes us all go ""Aha!"" Let's make sure the grant doesn't shrink like a wool sweater!","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I'll try my best... to find something useful. I just hope the history tells us something we can actually use for the future.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Takumi,,"Just make sure you're looking for the real problems, not just the easy answers. I'm not interested in a ""safe"" choice that fails anyway.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Minako,,"Let us proceed. Once we have the data on staffing and facility capacity, the right choice will become clear.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
